        {
          "id": "upload",
          "title": "Extract the fields you need",
          "description": "Upload a batch of PDFs with different layouts. The API sends each file to the File Processor. Gemini reads the available text or uses OCR on scans and fills the fields defined in a JSON schema. The worker checks each value against its format and source text before saving. Missing or ambiguous values stay null. This scenario assumes three seconds per PDF, with several files processed in parallel.",
